OL,3,GLondon & Southeast
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FSome clear
OL,6,Fspells to start the night but becoming
OL,7,Flargely cloudy, although remaining
OL,8,Fdry. Breezy overnight and generally
OL,9,Fmild, but winds starting to ease
OL,10,Ftowards dawn. Minimum Temperature 7C.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FRemaining cloudy on Monday but
OL,13,Flargely dry during the day, although a
OL,14,Ffew outbreaks of rain possible during
OL,15,Fthe morning. Breezy at times but winds
OL,16,Fbecoming light overnight. Maximum
OL,17,FTemperature 12C.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page BWeatherCReg Sport FNat Radio
