OL,3,GLondon & Southeast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FRain
OL,6,Ffor much of Tuesday, but cloud
OL,7,Fclearing later with frost and fog
OL,8,Fpossible overnight. Turning windy and
OL,9,Funsettled through Wednesday, with
OL,10,Fcloudy skies and outbreaks of rain
OL,11,Fcontinuing Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
